  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "触发点与零开销路径",
      "items": [
        "autoCompactIfNecessary 在每步 buildPrompt 前执行；shouldCompact(snapshot)==false 直接 return，不投影不压缩",
        "ContextProjector 投影只产报告不进记忆：本体修改只发生在 compact→restore 一步"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "失败语义",
      "items": [
        "compact 抛异常被吞掉（log + 继续用未压缩记忆）——压缩失败绝不破坏 run",
        "restore 后发布 MEMORY_COMPRESS + ON_COMPACT 生命周期事件；BEFORE_COMPACT 在压缩前发出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "策略谱系",
      "items": [
        "CompactPolicy 实现：WindowedMemoryCompressor 窗口截断 · LlmCompactPolicy 摘要 · StructuredSummaryCompactPolicy 结构化",
        "CompactPolicyMemoryCompressor 桥接旧 MemoryCompressor SPI；投影器分 Default/TypeAware 两实现"
      ]
    }
